  "scope": "Experimental OU-III controls only. Both use the actual OU-III core and wrapper with the published startup policy. Both zero-weight controls reproduced the unmodified OU-III metrics on all 16 records.",
  "setting": "Set RESEARCH_OU_INTEGRAL_WEIGHT to 0 for the control or 1 for horizontal matching. Set RESEARCH_OU_INTEGRAL_VARIANCE to 1 or 0.625. Matching starts after bias release. Each pair uses the same 1,200 s default-draw input and final 900 s.",
  "form": "H selects S and adds diag(beta,beta,0) times velocity, with beta=(tau_applied/tau_coeff/pi)^2. The observation noise is D R D with D diagonal (sqrt(variance),sqrt(variance),1). The constrained control updates attitude and gyro bias from the vertical innovation only.",
